  "description": "YIPQUN crystallizes in the trigonal crystal system with space group P -3. Reported CIF formula moiety: C78 H101 Ho4 N3 Ni3 O31,11(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Ho1 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Ho2 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ni1 (Ni) has 5 O neighbors; Ho3 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Ni2 (Ni) has 5 O neighbors; Ho4 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Ni3 (Ni) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 15 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.380-4.414 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 100.67-144.84°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C78H123Ho4N3Ni3O42. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 3 OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
